tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a destroy field rune (\"adito grav\").<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be used by monks, druids, sorcerers, paladins, knights with level 17 and magic level 3 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.70 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Destroys <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Field\">fire</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Field\">poison</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Field\">energy</a> fields, from any distance as long there's nothing blocking the path.<br/>This rune is useful to escape from PK traps in PvP worlds and is needed in a couple of quests. Previously it could be used to loot monsters that may be under the fields layed by other monsters until the introduction of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Quick%20Looting\">Quick Looting</a> mechanic, rendering this rune's usage still possible but obsolete.<br/>\nFor the spell, see <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field\">Destroy Field</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Asima\">Asima</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">